  "instructions": [
    "1. In a large bowl, combine the shredded green papaya, diced tomatoes, and sliced chilies.",
    "2. In a small pan, heat the peanuts over medium heat until fragrant.",
    "3. Add the peanuts to the bowl and toss to combine.",
    "4. In a small bowl, mix the fishing sauce, soy sauce, sugar, som tum prahok, and som tam sauce.",
    "5. Pour the sauce over the papaya mixture and toss to coat.",
    "6. Serve immediately and enjoy!"
